    "/v1/intake/preparation-packs/pack_synthetic_invoice_dispute_north/selections/{seat}": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Explicit synthetic publication. Server selects identity, current profile, template and canonical inputs. The intake seat has no publication grant. Exact key/body retries return the original historical receipt without mutation. Fresh identical publish is a non-success NO_CHANGE; no key/entry is retained. Withdraw forbids basis/interval fields and ignores stale business evidence or pack expiry; revoked/expired reviewer grants still deny.",
